# Documents every environment variable the project needs — names and shape only,
# NEVER real values. Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in locally.
# Agents: reference variables by name; never read or print values from .env.
#
# EXAMPLE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=<from your team's secret manager>
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@localhost:5432/dbname
